From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 19:29:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replace Catppuccin color theme with Alabaster as the sole
 highlighting theme

- Vendor tonsky.theme-alabaster v0.2.9 into plugins/ in the same
  unpacked-VSIX layout used for the existing plugins
- Swap the Catppuccin.catppuccin-vsc theiaPlugins entry for
  tonsky.theme-alabaster (open-vsx.org)
- Set workbench.colorTheme to "Alabaster" in both browser-app and
  electron-app package.json
- Whitelist plugins/tonsky.theme-alabaster/** in .gitignore in place
  of the old Catppuccin color-theme entry
- Update README, GETTING_STARTED, and QUICK_REFERENCE docs to
  describe Alabaster as the only bundled color theme

The Catppuccin icon theme (file/folder icons) and indent-rainbow
plugin are unaffected -- this only replaces syntax/color
highlighting.
